10	+Browsers create or join a private match by a six-character code and sail placeholder ships around the slice sea: four small islands with docks, shoals, and eight outer-sea spawn slots. Up (or W) sails ahead, down (S) brakes and then reverses, left and right (A, D) turn, and E docks a slow ship beside a dock. The authoritative server decides every position and sends each browser only the ships within its sight radius; the minimap's fog clears where the player has sailed.
